<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text-main">
        <span class="eyebrow">About Sunbright</span>
        <h2>A center built for healing.</h2>
        <p>Sunbright Recovery Center is preparing to open with one belief at its core: every person who walks through our doors deserves to be treated with dignity, met with compassion, and given real tools for lasting recovery.</p>
        <p>Our 16-bed residential center in Red Bluff will combine evidence-based therapy, faith-integrated support, and the warmth of a small community that learns your name and walks with you — through recovery, and long after.</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--soft);font-style:italic;">We've applied for 501(c)(3) nonprofit status — determination is pending. Our focus stays where it belongs: the people we'll serve.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-visual">
        <div class="aq-top">
          <span class="aq-mark">"</span>
          <blockquote>I've watched recovery happen for more than twenty years. It's real, it's possible, and it happens in safe places. So we built one — and the door is almost open.</blockquote>
          <cite>— Linda Spyres, LCSW, LAADC-CA · Founder</cite>
        </div>
        <div class="aq-heal">
          <p>Healing Today. Hope for Tomorrow. Freedom for Life.</p>
