            <strong>20+</strong>
            <span>Years of Experience</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY NONPROFIT MATTERS -->
<section class="nonprofit-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="np-head">
      <span class="np-eyebrow">Why Nonprofit Matters</span>
      <h2>Built differently — and that matters.</h2>
      <p>Most rehabs in California are owned by national chains. Sunbright is different. Every dollar — from donations and grants — goes back into care. Not profits. Not investors.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="nonprofit-grid">
      <div class="np-card">
        <div class="np-icon">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="np-card-body">
          <h3>Real care, not revenue targets</h3>
          <p>No upselling, no surprise charges, no quarterly earnings calls. Our only goal is recovery. No shareholders to answer to — just the people we serve.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="np-card">
        <div class="np-icon">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-2 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="np-card-body">
          <h3>Community-accountable</h3>
          <p>Governed by a board, built by the people of Northern California, answerable to our community — not Wall Street, not private equity. Your gift shapes what happens here.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="np-card">
        <div class="np-icon">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="np-card-body">
          <h3>Every dollar goes to care</h3>
          <p>From donations and grants to community sponsorships — every dollar funds a bed, a chair, a meal, or a counseling hour. Recovery is the only bottom line we track.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="np-note">We're completing our 501(c)(3) nonprofit determination with the IRS. Once approved, contributions will be tax-deductible charitable gifts. We'll confirm your gift's tax status with you directly.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT WE'LL OFFER -->
<section class="offer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-script">What we're planning</span>
      <h2 class="sec-h2">What Sunbright will offer</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">When we open, here's the care we're building toward — shaped by 20+ years of experience in addiction treatment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="offer-grid">
