        </div>
        <h3>Residential Recovery</h3>
        <p>We're planning 30, 60, and 90-day inpatient programs — full-time support in a safe, structured setting where healing can take root. Evidence-based therapy with the warmth of a small community.</p>
        <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--soft);font-style:italic;margin-top:12px;">Medical detox referrals will be coordinated through partner facilities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="offer-card">
        <div class="offer-top-bar"></div>
        <div class="offer-ico">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#c8900a" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Outpatient &amp; IOP</h3>
        <p>Intensive Outpatient programming — planned as a step-down option after residential care or as a primary level of care for those who need flexibility. Group therapy, individual counseling, and skills work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="offer-card">
        <div class="offer-top-bar"></div>
        <div class="offer-ico">
          <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#c8900a" stroke-width="1.75"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Sober Living &amp; Aftercare</h3>
        <p>Transitional support, sober community, and aftercare planning — so recovery doesn't end when residential treatment does. The goal is a clear path forward, not just a door out.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

